sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant OP as restore-drill.sh
    participant API as Public API (CloudFront)
    participant SRC as RDS guestbook-dev-postgres
    participant CPY as RDS …-postgres-drill-HHMM (new)
    participant T as One-off ECS task (same image + network)
    participant CW as CloudWatch Logs

    OP->>API: POST marker A
    Note over OP: T = now (UTC)
    OP->>API: POST marker B (must NOT survive the restore)
    loop until LatestRestorableTime > T
        OP->>SRC: describe-db-instances
    end
    OP->>SRC: restore-db-instance-to-point-in-time(restore-time = T)
    SRC-->>CPY: new instance, same subnet group + SG, not public
    Note over OP,CPY: RTO timer running
    OP->>CPY: wait db-instance-available
    Note over OP: RTO = elapsed seconds
    OP->>T: run-task with overrides: DB_HOST = copy, command = count(A), count(B)
    T->>CPY: SELECT over TLS from inside the VPC
    T->>CW: print DRILL_RESULT A=1 B=0
    OP->>CW: get-log-events
    alt A=1 and B=0
        Note over OP: PASS · restored to the exact second · report RTO
    else anything else
        Note over OP: FAIL
    end
    OP->>CPY: delete-db-instance (trap on EXIT, always cleans up)
